BAWA GYU-CHEOL KE SEKOLAH

01:02:41.090 --> 01:02:42.508
SUSAH HATI SEBELUM KERJA

01:02:42.592 --> 01:02:43.968
SAYA RISAUKAN GYU-CHEOL

01:02:45.094 --> 01:02:47.680
